[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":119},"routes/item",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8},"item",{"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":-5,"_20":21,"_22":23,"_24":25,"_26":27,"_28":-5,"_29":30,"_31":30,"_32":33,"_34":35,"_36":37,"_38":39,"_40":41,"_42":43,"_41":44,"_45":46,"_47":-5,"_48":-5,"_49":50,"_51":52,"_53":54,"_55":56,"_57":58,"_59":60,"_61":39,"_62":63,"_64":65,"_66":39,"_67":68},"id","wqg8upins71kmxmzdsleexzcl","revision",2,"title","亚马逊FBA费用月增超2.2万","originalTitle","Since April 10th, Amazon has raised our FBA fees over 22K a month. This is due to a fuel surcharge of 3.5% and Amazon trying to charge h...","summary","自4月10日起，亚马逊使我们的FBA费用每月增加超过2.2万美元。这是由于3.5%的燃油附加费，以及亚马逊试图在“旺季”收取更高费用，而亚马逊决定旺季从10月15日开始，这纯属胡扯。产品成本处于历史高位，而亚马逊还在涨价……","reason","source",{"_9":113,"_114":115,"_95":116,"_117":39,"_118":-5},"links",{"_110":111,"_68":112},"publishedAt","2026-10-21T14:22:10.000Z","publishedPrecision","timestamp","calendarDate","discoveredAt","2026-10-21T14:51:11.833Z","timelineAt","category","fba","tags",[107,108,109],"score",50,"selected",false,"channel","x","story",{"_77":78,"_13":79},{"_85":86,"_87":52,"_88":89,"_90":91,"_92":-5,"_45":93},"media",[],"byline","detailedGuide","readingMode","full","author","michaelpatron0","language","en","body",{"_81":-5,"_68":82,"_83":-5,"_84":63},"outline",[],"relatedStories",[80],"indexable","markdownAvailable",true,"group",{"_69":70,"_42":71,"_72":73,"_74":75,"_76":75},"hasTranslation","bodyLanguage","original","factId","fo70lk-ag1UE",{"_77":78,"_13":79},"reportCount",1,"additionalSourceCount",0,"developmentCount","publicId","1ffd8e21-e706-48ae-9e02-69043ff38fac","亚马逊卖家称FBA费用月增超2.2万美元",{"_77":78,"_13":79},"zh","<p>Since April 10th, Amazon has raised our FBA fees over 22K a month.  This is due to a fuel surcharge of 3.5% and Amazon trying to charge higher fees during \"peak\" which Amazon has decided starts on Oct 15th which is BS.  Product costs are at all time highs and Amazon is raising..</p>","zhKind","complete","authorName","Michae